Third-party code

* libs/SSDi8 (git submodule): our fork of SSDi8 (https://github.com/cau-hai-lab/SSDi8),
  which is itself derived from Quamba. It is distributed under its own license
  (libs/SSDi8/license.txt, the UT Austin Research License), not under the MIT license above.
* csrc/marlin_qqq: the Marlin QQQ W4A8 GEMM kernel from vLLM (Apache License 2.0;
  copyright notices in the source files).
* linquant/kernels/mamba2: INT8 variants of the Mamba-2 SSD Triton kernels from
  mamba-ssm (Apache License 2.0) and SSDi8.
* linquant/kernels/zoo: INT8 variants of the chunk kernels of flash-linear-attention (MIT License).
